        "statement": "If we terminate, discontinue or suspend, for longer than 12 months, the development of any product listed as a product under development in any development plan provided to Dong-A ST (other than for reasons of force majeure or requirements of applicable law), then we are deemed in breach of this development obligation, and Dong-A ST may terminate the 2018 License Agreement for cause after a 60-day cure period.",
